{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122832","id":4366168727,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBD5ylw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122832","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122832.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122832.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122832","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122832/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122832/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122832/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b0c13e4f07da7a52a9d96060e74ae9149f7626c0","number":122832,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Avoid nullptr memcpy in ShaderRD","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis code exists in `ShaderRD::save_shader_cache_bytes`:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nmemcpy(bytes_ptr, p_variant_data[variant_id].ptr(), p_variant_data[variant_id].size());\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe problem: `p_variant_data[variant_id]` is a PackedByteArray. If `.size()` is 0, then `.ptr()` is null, and this error occurs:\r\n\r\n```\r\nservers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp:1217:9: runtime error: null pointer passed as argument 2, which is declared to never be null\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a new `if (variant_size > 0) {` check, which prevents reaching the `.ptr()` that returns null, and prevents the invalid memcpy call. In order to do this check, I added a variable to store `variant_size`, since otherwise we would need to write `p_variant_data[variant_id].size()` 4 times.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI used AI to search for fixes to runtime errors on the godot-dimensions CI, and I am verifying each one as I submit upstream. I rewrote this myself, but ultimately came to the same code as what was generated.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubus